Problem 1: Identify those stidents and their subject where their makrs were more than total average marks
Problem 2: Identify the percentage of students who got more than 90% marks in any subject
Problem 3: Identify the second highest and second lowest for all subject
Problem 4: For each test and student, identify if their marks increased or decreased from previous test

---INPUT FILE---
CREATE TABLE students (
 studentid int NULL,
 studentname varchar(255) NULL,
 subject varchar(255) NULL,
 marks int NULL,
 testid int NULL,
 testdate date NULL
);

